&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You must use two Privy clients
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wallet ownership depends on your authorization key
One way to avoid silent errors is to use the latest versions of the packages.
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;




